<view class="page"><view class="teacher-banner"><text class="banner-label">今日课程</text><text class="banner-title">创意美术启蒙班</text><text class="banner-copy">10:00-11:30 · A校区 201 · 12位学员</text></view><view class="section"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">学生考勤</text><text class="tag">第4课</text></view><view class="card"><view class="student" wx:for="{{students}}" wx:key="id"><view class="avatar">{{item.initial}}</view><view class="student-info"><text class="student-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="muted">剩余 {{item.remaining}} 次课时</text></view><button class="state-btn {{item.state === '出勤' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-state="出勤" bindtap="toggle">出勤</button><button class="state-btn leave {{item.state === '请假' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-state="请假" bindtap="toggle">请假</button></view></view><view class="rule card"><text class="section-title">扣课规则</text><text class="muted">确认考勤后，出勤学员自动扣减 1 次有效课时；请假学员不扣课。</text></view><button class="primary-btn confirm" bindtap="confirm" disabled="{{locked}}">{{locked ? '已确认考勤' : '确认考勤并扣课时'}}</button></view></view>
